sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(21,101,192,0.04) Internal zone
    participant H as REST caller or a signal throw event
    participant E as Process Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (pre_signal, pre_event_subscription, pre_timer)
    participant W as Poller, any replica
  end
  rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
    Note over H,DB: TX0: the caller's tenant only, no waiting instance is locked
    H->>E: broadcast(name), tenant from the authenticated context or the throwing instance
    E->>DB: insert pre_signal (idempotent by signalId)
    E->>DB: one INSERT .. SELECT: a SIGNAL_DELIVERY job per subscription of this tenant and name, job id = subscription id
    E->>DB: start the effective version of each definition with a signal start of this name
    E->>DB: COMMIT with the caller's writes
  end
  loop each job, on any replica
    rect rgba(224,242,241,0.8)
      Note over W,DB: TXn: one waiter
      W->>DB: claim SIGNAL_DELIVERY with SKIP LOCKED and lease
      W->>DB: SELECT pre_instance FOR UPDATE, token still waits on this subscription?
      W->>DB: deliver, delete the subscription, history SIGNAL_RECEIVED, COMMIT
    end
  end
  alt the instance ended or the token moved on
    W->>DB: consume the job, delete the subscription, no effect
  end
